  "description": "• Furnished studio with raised sleeping platform\n• High ceilings and decorative cornicing\n• Large window providing natural light\n• Fitted kitchenette with washing machine\n• Separate shower room\n• Fitted storage\n• Portobello, Dublin 8 location\n\nEd Dempsey & Associates are pleased to present this compact furnished studio in Portobello, Dublin 8.\n\nFeaturing high ceilings, decorative cornicing and a large window, the property combines period character with a practical layout. The accommodation comprises an open-plan living area with a sofa and raised sleeping platform, a fitted kitchenette and a separate shower room.\n\nThe kitchenette includes an oven, hob, under-counter fridge and washing machine, while fitted storage provides space for everyday essentials. The raised bed makes efficient use of the studio’s floor area, with seating beneath.",
